<!--
  Info.plist fragment merged into the bundled Info.plist by cargo-bundle
  via [package.metadata.bundle] osx_info_plist_exts. The content is
  spliced verbatim into the top-level <dict>, so this file must NOT
  contain a <plist> or <dict> wrapper.

  LSUIElement = true makes the launched process an "agent" with no Dock
  tile and no Cmd-Tab entry, matching Ropy's tray-app UX. Setting it in
  Info.plist is the only way to avoid the brief Dock-icon flash on cold
  launch — calling -[NSApplication setActivationPolicy:] at runtime is
  too late, since launch services has already registered the process.
-->
<key>LSUIElement</key>
<true/>
